{"html_text": {"ja378:0.1": "<article id='ja378'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja378:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja378:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja378:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja378:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja378:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja378:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja378:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja378:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja378:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja378:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja378:7.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja378:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja378:0.2": "Chakkanipāta ", "ja378:0.3": "Avāriyavagga ", "ja378:0.4": "3. Darīmukhajātaka ", "ja378:1.1": "“Paṅko ca kāmā palipo ca kāmā, ", "ja378:1.2": "Bhayañca metaṁ timūlaṁ pavuttaṁ; ", "ja378:1.3": "Rajo ca dhūmo ca mayā pakāsitā, ", "ja378:1.4": "Hitvā tuvaṁ pabbaja brahmadatta”. ", "ja378:2.1": "“Gadhito ca ratto ca adhimucchito ca, ", "ja378:2.2": "Kāmesvahaṁ brāhmaṇa bhiṁsarūpaṁ; ", "ja378:2.3": "Taṁ nussahe jīvikattho pahātuṁ, ", "ja378:2.4": "Kāhāmi puññāni anappakāni”. ", "ja378:3.1": "“Yo atthakāmassa hitānukampino, ", "ja378:3.2": "Ovajjamāno na karoti sāsanaṁ; ", "ja378:3.3": "Idameva seyyo iti maññamāno, ", "ja378:3.4": "Punappunaṁ gabbhamupeti mando. ", "ja378:4.1": "So ghorarūpaṁ nirayaṁ upeti, ", "ja378:4.2": "Subhāsubhaṁ muttakarīsapūraṁ; ", "ja378:4.3": "Sattā sakāye na jahanti giddhā, ", "ja378:4.4": "Ye honti kāmesu avītarāgā”. ", "ja378:5.1": "“Mīḷhena littā ruhirena makkhitā, ", "ja378:5.2": "Semhena littā upanikkhamanti; ", "ja378:5.3": "Yaṁ yañhi kāyena phusanti tāvade, ", "ja378:5.4": "Sabbaṁ asātaṁ dukhameva kevalaṁ. ", "ja378:6.1": "Disvā vadāmi na hi aññato savaṁ, ", "ja378:6.2": "Pubbenivāsaṁ bahukaṁ sarāmi; ", "ja378:6.3": "Citrāhi gāthāhi subhāsitāhi, ", "ja378:6.4": "Darīmukho nijjhāpayi sumedhan”ti. ", "ja378:7.1": "Darīmukhajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja378:0.1": "", "ja378:0.2": "", "ja378:0.3": "", "ja378:0.4": "", "ja378:1.1": "", "ja378:1.2": "", "ja378:1.3": "", "ja378:1.4": "", "ja378:2.1": "Gadhito → gathito (bj); gatito (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja378:2.2": "", "ja378:2.3": "", "ja378:2.4": "", "ja378:3.1": "", "ja378:3.2": "", "ja378:3.3": "", "ja378:3.4": "", "ja378:4.1": "", "ja378:4.2": "", "ja378:4.3": "", "ja378:4.4": "", "ja378:5.1": "", "ja378:5.2": "", "ja378:5.3": "", "ja378:5.4": "", "ja378:6.1": "", "ja378:6.2": "", "ja378:6.3": "", "ja378:6.4": "", "ja378:7.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja378:0.1": "", "ja378:0.2": "", "ja378:0.3": "", "ja378:0.4": "", "ja378:1.1": "ms22J_1333, msdiv14, ndp22.130, pts-vp-pli3.241", "ja378:1.2": "", "ja378:1.3": "", "ja378:1.4": "", "ja378:2.1": "csp1ed22.139, csp2ed22.139, ms22J_1334, msdiv15, pts-vp-pli3.242", "ja378:2.2": "", "ja378:2.3": "", "ja378:2.4": "", "ja378:3.1": "ms22J_1335, msdiv16, pts-vp-pli3.243, sya27.190", "ja378:3.2": "", "ja378:3.3": "", "ja378:3.4": "", "ja378:4.1": "dr27.189, ms22J_1336, msdiv17", "ja378:4.2": "", "ja378:4.3": "", "j